 "notes": [
  "Posted 4 June 2001, before Coruscant; the list has no Coruscant-set card, so the format is Premiere - Tatooine.",
  "Starting cards as posted under 'Starting(7)': Rebel Strike Team / Garrison Destroyed ('RST/GD'), Endor: Landing Platform ('EndorLanding Platfrom'), Endor, The Shield Is Down!, Heading For The Medical Frigate ('HFTMF'), Strike Planning and Squadron Assignments; these count toward the 60. The three Effects are the kind Heading For The Medical Frigate starts; none is named as the starting Effect, so none is singled out.",
  "The objective's text deploys Endor and Rebel Landing Site, but the post lists 'EndorLanding Platfrom'; kept as posted (Endor: Landing Platform (Docking Bay)).",
  "Posted 'Gen Madine' dested General Crix Madine; 'Beezer' Corporal Beezer; 'Corp Mildge' Corporal Midge; 'Lt Greeve'/'Lt Page' Lieutenant Greeve/Page; 'Chewy OK' Chewbacca Of Kashyyyk; 'Endor Forest Trail' Endor: Hidden Forest Trail; 'Jungle (NU)' the Special Edition generic site Jungle; 'Anakins stick' Anakin's Lightsaber; 'Chewys Bowcaster' Chewbacca's Bowcaster; 'Deactivate Shiedl Generator' the Epic Event Deactivate The Shield Generator; 'Battle Plan' the Light Endor Effect; 'YISYW' Your Insight Serves You Well; 'HOTJ' Honor Of The Jedi; 'Wedge RSL' Wedge Antilles, Red Squadron Leader; 'Gen Calrissian' General Calrissian; 'DOS' Daughter Of Skywalker.",
